Description: Drop the Python 3.14 classifier
 hatchling 1.21 in Ubuntu 24.04 checks classifiers against a list that does
 not have "Programming Language :: Python :: 3.14" yet, and refuses to build.
 The classifier is metadata only; the package still runs on 3.14.
Author: Robert August Vincent II (Bob) <pillarsdotnet@gmail.com>
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-10-02
--- a/pyproject.toml
+++ b/pyproject.toml
@@ -21,7 +21,6 @@ classifiers = [
     "Programming Language :: Python :: 3.11",
     "Programming Language :: Python :: 3.12",
     "Programming Language :: Python :: 3.13",
-    "Programming Language :: Python :: 3.14",
 ]
 
 [project.optional-dependencies]
